  <h1 class="page-title">Onsight / Redpoint Gap</h1>

  <div class="mb-5" id="view-explainer">
    <p class="text-[.95rem] text-foreground leading-[1.7]">How your first-attempt sends compare to your eventual sends over time — is the gap between the two closing, or is one metric stalling?</p>
    <p class="text-[.82rem] text-muted leading-[1.7] mt-2">Two lines track your best first-attempt (flash/onsight) grade and your best eventual-send grade per period; the bars behind them show average <strong class="text-foreground font-semibold">attempts</strong> needed per send. Built from the <strong class="text-foreground font-semibold">Attempts</strong> count and <strong class="text-foreground font-semibold">Flash</strong> selection on each send.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="row-card text-center max-w-[420px] mx-auto" id="performance-offline" hidden>
    <p class="text-[.9rem] text-foreground">Performance insights need a connection.</p>
    <p class="text-[.82rem] text-muted mt-2">Reconnect and reload this page to see your onsight/redpoint gap.</p>
  </div>

