  <h2 class="sources-heading">Sources</h2>
  <p class="text-[.82rem] text-muted leading-[1.7] mb-3">The onsight/redpoint gap widening as climbers get stronger is a pattern observed in self-reported community logging data, not a peer-reviewed study -- a useful sanity-check metric, not a settled scientific claim.</p>
