    <li>"How much harder is onsighting vs redpointing?" Climbstat (data-analysis blog built on 8a.nu data). <a class="text-accent" href="http://climbstat.blogspot.com/2020/02/how-much-harder-is-onsighting-vs.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">climbstat.blogspot.com ↗</a></li>
  </ol>

